# Hedera Sentinel Marketplace - Environment Variables

# ============================================
# HEDERA CREDENTIALS
# ============================================
# Get your free testnet account at: https://portal.hedera.com/dashboard

# Your Hedera testnet account ID (format: 0.0.xxxxx)
HEDERA_ACCOUNT_ID=0.0.xxxxx

# Your Hedera private key in ECDSA format (starts with 302e...)
# IMPORTANT: This should be your ECDSA encoded private key, NOT DER format
HEDERA_PRIVATE_KEY=302e020100300506032b657004220420...

# ============================================
# AI MODEL API KEY
# ============================================
# Get your free Groq API key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# Groq provides fast LLM inference for the AI agents

GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# ============================================
# OPTIONAL: ALTERNATIVE AI PROVIDERS
# ============================================
# You can use OpenAI, Anthropic, or other providers instead of Groq
# Uncomment and add your API key if you want to use them

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ============================================
# NOTES
# ============================================
# 1. DO NOT commit this file to git
# 2. Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials
# 3. Use testnet credentials only for development
# 4. Keep your private keys secure
